WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.734
- [Announcer] Shot clock is off.
Crowd comes to its feet.

00:00:02.734 --> 00:00:05.255
The atmosphere in this place is electric.

00:00:05.276 --> 00:00:06.923
- [Announcer] This building is shaking.

00:00:06.923 --> 00:00:08.758
- [Announcer] It is deafening in here.

00:00:08.787 --> 00:00:10.309
- [Announcer] Bogdanovic...up.

00:00:10.309 --> 00:00:11.897
- [Announcer] Got it! It's over!

00:00:11.902 --> 00:00:13.888
- [Announcer] What a scene.

00:00:22.880 --> 00:00:23.273
- Man.

00:00:24.780 --> 00:00:25.980
When the season halted.

00:00:26.130 --> 00:00:28.270
Oh my goodness, bro, it hurt.

00:00:29.330 --> 00:00:34.260
- Being in OKC, we got to witness
firsthand the postponing of the season,

00:00:36.330 --> 00:00:38.240
and the fans are just left clueless.

00:00:38.290 --> 00:00:41.250
And in that day, you kind of
felt the levity of the situation.

00:00:41.470 --> 00:00:46.069
- That made a lot of sense to stop it, when we
didn't know much about what we were facing.

00:00:46.290 --> 00:00:48.580
- With COVID, life paused.

00:00:48.950 --> 00:00:49.879
Things changed.

00:00:50.360 --> 00:00:51.330
The world stopped.

00:00:51.480 --> 00:00:55.129
- When the season halted, it
was just like, OK, what next?

00:00:55.550 --> 00:01:00.913
- I was disappointed, obviously, because as a
superfan, I look forward to going into TD Garden.

00:01:00.913 --> 00:01:05.720
- [Snoop Dogg] I really do miss sports in general,
just watching the competition and whether

00:01:05.720 --> 00:01:08.460
I'm at the arena or at home just missing.

00:01:08.830 --> 00:01:10.669
- It's like you're on a high.

00:01:10.959 --> 00:01:12.680
And all of a sudden the pandemic hits.

00:01:13.490 --> 00:01:15.160
Man, you on a low again.

00:01:15.340 --> 00:01:19.289
- All reports say the NBA is
inching closer to returning.

00:01:19.670 --> 00:01:20.190
- I need you.

00:01:20.789 --> 00:01:21.689
It's been sad.

00:01:22.400 --> 00:01:24.420
It's been so sad and lonely without sports.

00:01:24.920 --> 00:01:27.789
- Before the pandemic hit, oh my goodness, baby.

00:01:28.199 --> 00:01:29.200
We was on our way.

00:01:29.279 --> 00:01:32.590
- Just was feelin' good, like, you know,
we was set to, to really catch a groove.

00:01:32.620 --> 00:01:36.380
- I just hope they're able to recapture some
of that going into the bubble in Orlando.

00:01:42.500 --> 00:01:45.109
- My name is Darrell Bailey,
man, but y'all know me, baby.

00:01:45.409 --> 00:01:47.543
Aka Clipper Darrell in the building, baby.

00:01:47.869 --> 00:01:49.550
- My name is Nav Bhatia.

00:01:49.630 --> 00:01:52.649
- My name is Garrett Haviland,
but you all know me as Thundor.

00:01:53.270 --> 00:01:56.130
-This is Nasser Abasali, aka Aztec Gino.

00:01:56.130 --> 00:01:58.240
- It's ya boy, big Snoop D.O. Double G.

00:01:58.240 --> 00:02:00.289
King of the West Coast, representing the Lakers.

00:02:00.759 --> 00:02:03.580
- I've been supporting the Thunder
since the very first season.

00:02:03.700 --> 00:02:08.009
- Since my college days coming from the
beautiful islands of Trinidad and Tobago.

00:02:08.110 --> 00:02:15.489
- When NBA arrived in Toronto, I fell in love,
and I've never missed a game for last 25 years.

00:02:15.660 --> 00:02:16.520
- I decided, you know what?

00:02:16.550 --> 00:02:17.350
I got a big gut.

00:02:18.070 --> 00:02:19.249
Beautiful mural painting.

00:02:19.259 --> 00:02:20.289
So why not go with it?

00:02:20.370 --> 00:02:22.330
The very first painting was a jack-o'-lantern.

00:02:22.480 --> 00:02:24.579
Deron Williams went to shoot
a technical free throw.

00:02:25.100 --> 00:02:28.590
Ripped my shirt off and unveiled
the first Thundor belly art.

00:02:29.910 --> 00:02:33.939
- Since the pandemic, man, what I've missed about
basketball is the comradery with the fans.

00:02:34.000 --> 00:02:35.600
- We are like one big family.

00:02:35.750 --> 00:02:38.720
When I go to the game, it's
my whole extended family.

00:02:38.759 --> 00:02:42.930
- From a fan's perspective, it's
disappointing not to attend the games.

00:02:43.160 --> 00:02:46.589
- But my players know that we are
going to be there in spirit.

00:02:46.589 --> 00:02:47.860
- [Kyle Lowry] It's going to be different.

00:02:47.960 --> 00:02:50.040
We know that they're supporting us no matter what.

00:02:50.040 --> 00:02:53.309
- To know that I'm not going to be
there to cheer my guys on is going

00:02:53.309 --> 00:02:55.959
to be just a complete mind explosion.

00:02:56.160 --> 00:02:57.769
- I'm thinking about going to Orlando, man.

00:02:57.770 --> 00:02:58.780
Just stand by the door.

00:02:58.949 --> 00:03:00.599
Hopefully, somebody let me in.

00:03:01.429 --> 00:03:06.799
- I don't think people understand how much
energy all the fans bring to the game.

00:03:06.799 --> 00:03:09.870
- [Snoop Dogg] The way the crowd roars,
the adrenaline that you give is just a

00:03:09.870 --> 00:03:11.420
certain feeling that can't be matched.

00:03:11.550 --> 00:03:14.720
- [Aztec Gino] All of the superfans
is to make sure everyone who attends

00:03:14.830 --> 00:03:16.880
a game enjoys the whole ambiance.

00:03:16.880 --> 00:03:20.460
- [Kyle] Having their raw emotion, guys
can feed off of that energy, and it

00:03:20.460 --> 00:03:21.940
kind of brings everything together.

00:03:21.990 --> 00:03:24.760
- Not having fans in the building is
definitely gonna impact the players.

00:03:24.780 --> 00:03:27.640
- [Thundor] When they go to shoot free throws, I
mean, who's going to be there to distract them?

00:03:27.640 --> 00:03:31.330
- [Aztec Gino] The players are going to
miss feeding off the energy of the crowd.

00:03:31.860 --> 00:03:33.730
- [Kyle] Just because you're not
there, don't mean you're forgotten.

00:03:33.849 --> 00:03:35.209
We know that you're there.

00:03:35.209 --> 00:03:36.469
We're gonna play hard for you guys.

00:03:36.469 --> 00:03:38.040
- I just don't know, man.

00:03:38.160 --> 00:03:40.030
I can't be there to cheer my guys.

00:03:40.030 --> 00:03:41.040
Man, this hurts.

00:03:41.710 --> 00:03:44.239
- [Thundor] When I get to go back to
a full arena, getting to see all the

00:03:44.240 --> 00:03:46.350
familiar faces, my usher, Gaylord.

00:03:46.540 --> 00:03:48.970
Like I know I'm going to have to
give that dude a big old bear hug.

00:03:48.970 --> 00:03:52.809
- [Nav] When I go back to the arena,
I'm going to be back with my family.

00:03:52.809 --> 00:03:54.318
- [Thundor] The high-fives, handshakes and hugs.

00:03:54.318 --> 00:03:56.190
- [Aztec Gino] They all take photos with me.

00:03:56.410 --> 00:03:57.690
You know, they like it when I do that.

00:03:57.690 --> 00:04:00.180
- [Kyle] I can't wait to get
them back in our building.

00:04:00.370 --> 00:04:04.939
- [Clipper Darrell] What I'm looking forward
to the most, man, seeing my 2020 L.A.

00:04:04.940 --> 00:04:07.090
Clippers champions, baby, getting them rings.

00:04:07.090 --> 00:04:07.880
- [Aztec Gino] I like their chances.

00:04:08.160 --> 00:04:09.180
We have a great team.

00:04:09.190 --> 00:04:10.839
- [Nav] We are the defending champions.

00:04:10.869 --> 00:04:15.850
The first time, the world didn't believe us,
but they're going to prove them wrong again.

00:04:16.019 --> 00:04:17.370
- Who can stop us, baby?

00:04:17.370 --> 00:04:18.320
I'm telling you, man.

00:04:18.399 --> 00:04:19.530
It's our time.

00:04:19.550 --> 00:04:20.409
- Come on, Thunder.

00:04:20.889 --> 00:04:23.530
I need you to rise up and dominate.

00:04:23.599 --> 00:04:26.060
- We know you guys are still
there, and we appreciate you.

00:04:26.060 --> 00:04:26.719
And we need you.

00:04:26.820 --> 00:04:28.720
- You take care of the business in Orlando.

00:04:28.840 --> 00:04:30.550
I take care of the business in Toronto.

00:04:30.550 --> 00:04:31.530
- Stay safe.

00:04:32.020 --> 00:04:32.370
- Stay healthy.

00:04:32.910 --> 00:04:34.450
- Championship or nothing.

00:04:34.730 --> 00:04:36.280
We gotta come back home with that thing.

00:04:36.320 --> 00:04:39.054
- When I say L.A., you say Clippers.

00:04:39.054 --> 00:04:39.862
L.A.!

00:04:39.862 --> 00:04:41.163
- O-K-C.

00:04:41.175 --> 00:04:42.365
O-K-C.

00:04:42.365 --> 00:04:43.195
- Celtics.

00:04:43.195 --> 00:04:44.867
No. 1

00:04:45.170 --> 00:04:46.590
- Go, Raptors, go.

